Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,To those coming from the MacBook video, welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.97,0:00:04.15,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And to those new here,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.15,0:00:08.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,introducing my Microsoft Surface Pro 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:09.92,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And we're going to talk about how the hell
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.92,0:00:12.50,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I procured this piece of history
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.07,0:00:14.37,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(776,392)}*fart*
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.50,0:00:15.63,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,that currently shapes the way Microslop does their things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.02,0:00:15.63,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(796,393)}Microslop (Meme)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.73,0:00:18.42,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Kon-Melo, it's ya Tech Wizardess MeloriTensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.63,0:00:20.63,Music,,0,0,0,,♫Doraichi - stay close♫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.42,0:00:22.62,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And umm... yeah, Microsoft Surface Pro 1. You've heard that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.62,0:00:27.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,This is the x86 tablet that was launched in 2013.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.32,0:00:28.55,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And you might be wondering,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.55,0:00:30.92,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"Oh Mel, didn't you got a MacBook on 2011?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.63,0:00:33.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Check out the previous vid\Nif you haven't already
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.92,0:00:33.48,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell did you get another compooter?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.48,0:00:35.85,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Well, umm... I hate to say this, umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.85,0:00:38.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,sometimes there's only Windows applications.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.90,0:00:39.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(1512,613)}Eheh
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.77,0:00:42.45,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So I was looking for a Windows laptop,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.45,0:00:43.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and I was doing some laptop shopping,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.93,0:00:46.87,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and I wanted something that looked really unique.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.87,0:00:47.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And, umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.83,0:00:51.62,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,a salesperson kind of took my instructions way too literal,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.62,0:00:54.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and took us to a very unusual corner,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.90,0:00:58.30,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and that is a brand new Microsoft table.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.57,0:00:59.25,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(768,176)}(Microsoft table in a Costco)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.30,0:01:03.25,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And he said, this is made by Microsoft, the people behind Windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.25,0:01:05.25,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And I kind of went, whoa, this is a...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.25,0:01:06.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,is this a laptop?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.97,0:01:08.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"No ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.67,0:01:10.98,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,It's a tablet."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.78,0:01:12.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Average 13 y.o. Mel reaction
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.13,0:01:13.05,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And I went, "whoa~",
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.05,0:01:14.73,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"so this is like the iPad?"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.73,0:01:16.45,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"Yeah, but it runs Windows."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.45,0:01:19.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And then I went, "whoa!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.55,0:01:19.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Not-So-Average 13 y.o. Mel reaction
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.43,0:01:20.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake\an5\pos(1498,690)}Hahahaha~
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.83,0:01:25.38,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,You can tell how halfway Gen Z and halfway Boomer I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.38,0:01:29.92,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Like, the Mac video was very much just showing me a Boomer,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.92,0:01:32.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and this video is probably gonna show a Zoomer side of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.77,0:01:34.42,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.42,0:01:38.15,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Today-me feels a little embarrassed over the fact that,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.15,0:01:42.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"Oh dear, innocent little Mel didn't discover that there are tablet PCs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.17,0:01:45.08,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(760,205)}(Windows XP Tablet PC)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.88,0:01:45.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,all over the place that ran Windows XP.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.17,0:01:47.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,If you have watched enough MichaelMJD videos,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.17,0:01:48.22,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Check his vid out, it's SO awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.18,0:01:48.35,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,you would have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.35,0:01:52.30,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I knew him around then, but unfortunately, I did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.30,0:01:56.30,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So, this was my first entry to tablet PC,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.30,0:01:58.42,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and it started off in Windows 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.42,0:02:00.05,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Horrendous software, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.70,0:02:01.70,Music,,0,0,0,,♫Doraichi - White Christmas♫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.05,0:02:03.45,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,However, I think the Metro UI was pretty good for touchscreens,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.45,0:02:08.03,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,but it genuinely sucks when it's not touchscreen, like on PC.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.35,0:02:08.45,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(809,153)}(Windows 8 Metro UI)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.03,0:02:11.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Like, I didn't learn how to alt-tab until Windows 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.90,0:02:13.07,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Can you believe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.07,0:02:16.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Windows 8 taught me to leave fullscreen application
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.47,0:02:18.28,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an8}Meme: Oh my god, oh, hell naw!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.88,0:02:18.38,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,with a Windows key!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.38,0:02:23.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Not directly, but like, I sort of found that as a method instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.17,0:02:24.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And it kind of sucked,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.43,0:02:27.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,because I didn't know that you can alt-tab
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.13,0:02:28.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,like way, way, way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.88,0:02:31.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And I've learned to alt-tab on Windows 11,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.17,0:02:33.92,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I kind of went, "whoa, has this thing been around?"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.92,0:02:35.48,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And then I looked through the history of alt-tab,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.48,0:02:39.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and I went, "oh fuck, what is wrong with me?"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.77,0:02:43.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And umm, ever since then, I've never turned back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.00,0:02:46.07,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Alt-tab is the way, guys! Alt-tab is the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.07,0:02:47.35,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(1634,312)}H- hehe
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.35,0:02:51.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta unlearn the fact that Windows leaves fullscreen applications as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:53.35,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,like Team Fortress 2 and stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.35,0:02:56.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that was a very painful history of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.17,0:03:00.58,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But anyways, that aside, umm I genuinely like the stylus,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.58,0:03:03.02,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,because if you do install some stuff like Photoshop,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.78,0:03:06.48,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(709,180)}(Photoshop screenshot demo-ing pen pressure sensitivity)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.02,0:03:07.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,it actually behaves like a proper drawing tablet, but on screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.17,0:03:10.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So it feels like a tablet with display,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.18,0:03:12.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,but it actually functions as everything else as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.78,0:03:15.02,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So it's like, you got a stylus, you got a touchscreen,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.02,0:03:17.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,you got a keyboard, trackpad, all that st- all that jazz.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.83,0:03:19.40,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But when you first get the device,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.40,0:03:21.10,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,it doesn't really come with a keyboard,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.10,0:03:24.05,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and I didn't know about that until we got to the checkout,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.05,0:03:26.63,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and the salesperson told my mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.63,0:03:27.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"this thing doesn't come with a keyboard"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.78,0:03:29.52,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm like, "wait, what? Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.52,0:03:32.10,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,What was that on the display then?"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.10,0:03:34.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"Oh, that's another additional 50-ish bucks."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.93,0:03:37.38,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1568,312)}(Mel processing...)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.38,0:03:38.08,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}はい？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.38,0:03:38.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hai? (Excuse me?)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.17,0:03:41.60,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So you're saying I have to pay $59.90?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.67,0:03:43.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}Ach... eugh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.57,0:03:45.85,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so strong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.85,0:03:47.02,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Freaking...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.02,0:03:49.35,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Just so I get this thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.35,0:03:50.85,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And yes, you might be wondering,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.85,0:03:53.05,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,yes, extensive use.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.05,0:03:55.73,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Um, yup, I've played a lot of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.45,0:03:58.45,Music,,0,0,0,,♫Doraichi - ひとりぼっちの宇宙紀行 (A Solo Journey Through the Universe)♫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.73,0:03:58.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta be honest, because it's Windows, because it's x86,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.75,0:04:02.15,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I've actually played way more stuff that I couldn't do on the Mac.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.15,0:04:04.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So I've actually installed emulators,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.93,0:04:07.38,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and I've played certain emulator games.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.38,0:04:10.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Can't say which game, but I did play them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.00,0:04:12.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And of course, I have played Roblox on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.32,0:04:14.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,The active fan makes me feel a little assured
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.47,0:04:16.40,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,that there is active cooling going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.40,0:04:17.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, there is also fans on the Mac,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.67,0:04:19.35,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,but what did the little Mel know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.35,0:04:20.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(1608,498)}Hehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.28,0:04:21.45,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,No. But yeah, I did game on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.45,0:04:22.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I kind of put WASD on it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.95,0:04:25.52,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and I just go, oh my god, I'm playing all those games.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.52,0:04:26.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I played Unturned a lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.75,0:04:29.63,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and um, woo! What an experience, I gotta be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.82,0:04:31.03,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(774,128)}[Unturned (Game)]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.63,0:04:32.85,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And, and also, having a kickstand is actually a plus.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.85,0:04:34.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that is satisfying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.78,0:04:38.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So, I've also learned how to install other OS with it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.17,0:04:40.92,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,but I found myself coming back to Windows every time,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.92,0:04:43.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,because I generally don't see an appeal of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.47,0:04:46.15,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,The last time I've actually installed a different OS
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.15,0:04:49.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,was I was installing Android x86,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.18,0:04:52.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and I tried using it as an Android tablet in university,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.70,0:04:55.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and let's just say things didn't go right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.70,0:04:57.18,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(782,102)}(Android x86)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.37,0:04:57.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I found myself going back to Windows again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.28,0:04:58.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\move(1480,540,1480,750)}Ahh~
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.53,0:05:00.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"But Mel, why didn't you try out Linux?"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.75,0:05:04.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, around then, I... I hadn't discovered Ubuntu yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.43,0:05:05.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(1466,434)}Ehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.47,0:05:07.85,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I was a very late comer to the Linux gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.85,0:05:11.12,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I discovered Linux in 2020, unfortunately.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.12,0:05:12.30,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(1546,677)}Hehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.30,0:05:15.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But nonetheless, I mean, I'm here, so it kind of shows it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.77,0:05:19.72,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,At least 75% of all computers here are Linux now, so
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.72,0:05:23.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I think the only Windows computers are this main PC
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.75,0:05:26.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and the Steam Deck on dual-boot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.43,0:05:29.80,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, there's no other Windows machine, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.80,0:05:33.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But yeah, um, back to the Surface.  Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.67,0:05:36.08,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I found the Surface to be very portable,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.08,0:05:37.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,so I can just carry this little thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.97,0:05:40.25,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Just like the MacBook, um, same thinness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.25,0:05:43.58,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, not quite same, but like, same philosophy, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.58,0:05:45.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,It's easy to carry around, and, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.88,0:05:48.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,it's technically a computer that you can carry around,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.47,0:05:49.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and it works great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.47,0:05:51.72,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,It has a back camera that I barely use.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.72,0:05:53.27,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody fucking uses it anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.27,0:05:54.25,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake\an5\pos(1485,512)}Ehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.52,0:05:56.52,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Neither did the front camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.52,0:05:57.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.93,0:05:59.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,There's this microphone up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.78,0:06:02.22,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell you certified, it's trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.22,0:06:04.02,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Like, dog shit trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.55,0:06:07.78,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(762,740)}Original Razer Seiren
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.02,0:06:07.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,It's so bad, I've gone out of my way to buy a Razor Seiren
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.93,0:06:09.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,just to solve this issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.77,0:06:11.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And, um, unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.78,0:06:11.78,Music,,0,0,0,,♫Doraichi - 小さな神様 (A Little Goddess)♫
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.47,0:06:14.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Can you imagine I've spent, like, freaking hundreds of dollars just-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.83,0:06:17.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,just getting a Razer Seiren? Psychopathic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.75,0:06:19.45,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And all I did in the current era
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.37,0:06:22.27,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(725,536)}Two of my older video:\NBrainrot Girlfriend ASMR, ASMR Trigger Test
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.45,0:06:22.38,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,is to make ASMRs out of it. What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.38,0:06:25.07,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Um, yeah, I played a lot of TF2.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.07,0:06:27.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,TF2 was way playable here. And, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.40,0:06:28.48,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\pos(785,130)\an5}(Meet the Team Theme)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.78,0:06:28.98,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,yeah, I've actually had a lot of fun
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.98,0:06:31.73,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,playing a lot of Team Fortress 2 around then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.73,0:06:34.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Um, if you want to hear me yap about Team Fortress 2 a little more,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.83,0:06:36.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,check out the Mac video.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.90,0:06:38.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get right through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.90,0:06:40.73,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I've played a lot of Counter-Strike as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.73,0:06:42.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Um, I've played Global Offensive,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.95,0:06:45.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and... y'all remember Global Offensive?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.62,0:06:48.10,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\pos(785,130)\an5}(CS:GO trailer ending)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.88,0:06:48.57,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I did play some 1.6, but it wasn't for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.57,0:06:49.42,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I did play some Source,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.42,0:06:52.57,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,but it sort of wasn't for me on this specific tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.72,0:06:55.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I kind of prefer playing it on a desktop computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.47,0:06:57.85,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So, yeah, I played Global Offensive,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.85,0:07:01.85,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and I played a lot competitively around then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.85,0:07:03.30,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Until I finally got a desktop,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.30,0:07:05.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and I started playing Global Offensive there instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.78,0:07:08.62,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And to those wondering, I peaked at Gold Nova 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.78,0:07:09.45,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(760,332)}CS:GO Gold Nova 1 Competitive Rank
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.62,0:07:09.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake\an5\pos(1477,498)}Ehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.68,0:07:12.62,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But yeah, um, I gotta be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.62,0:07:14.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,it's a pretty durable device as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.78,0:07:17.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, till this day, it still sort of works,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.75,0:07:19.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,with some exceptions, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.90,0:07:21.25,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,The exceptions being...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.25,0:07:23.40,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,that if you look over here, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.40,0:07:26.58,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,the texture of this thing is a little rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.58,0:07:30.38,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So, there may be a bit of corrosion happening or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.38,0:07:32.07,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And then secondly, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.07,0:07:33.55,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,because of those corrosions,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.55,0:07:37.48,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and on top of extensive, uh, plugs and unplugs,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.48,0:07:42.08,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,the connectors for the power is slowly not meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.08,0:07:44.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So, that means, uh, if I want to charge this thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.75,0:07:47.42,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I have to not only, like, clip it in,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.42,0:07:51.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,sort of like, I'm just using this stylus as a, as a demonstration.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.90,0:07:54.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So, I have to click it in,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.47,0:07:56.48,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and it surprisingly doesn't want to click in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.48,0:08:01.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And then, angle it sideways like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.97,0:08:04.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Like, I have to play around with the angles
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.28,0:08:07.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,until I find the power LED starts lighting up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.97,0:08:08.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake\an5\pos(1557,605)}Ehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.30,0:08:10.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And you might be wondering,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.13,0:08:11.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"why don't you just get into self-repair?"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.38,0:08:16.57,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I said something so fatally wrong here,\Nsorry for the voice over! >.<
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.22,0:08:16.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Um, unfortunately, procuring parts in Asia is an absolute nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.83,0:08:19.80,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And I really don't want to get into that at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.80,0:08:22.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So, if I were to look around locally,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.83,0:08:25.03,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,a lot of the stores might say,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.03,0:08:26.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"no, I don't think I've ever heard of that",
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.97,0:08:28.38,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,or something like that. So...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.38,0:08:32.12,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,self-repair here is, without a doubt, a living hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.12,0:08:34.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike y'all in Europe and North America,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.93,0:08:36.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,y'all can self-repair willy-nilly
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.95,0:08:40.22,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,because there's parts going around all over the place in circulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.22,0:08:41.42,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Here, it's like,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.42,0:08:44.20,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Eh... You would just swap out the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.20,0:08:46.57,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Self-repair is, like, pretty rare here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.57,0:08:48.73,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Not non-existent, just rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.73,0:08:51.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So, yeah. I do want to dive into self-repair.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.75,0:08:52.62,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.62,0:08:56.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,this Microsoft Surface gave me my first ever life lesson
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.33,0:08:58.45,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,on what not to do in self-repair.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.60,0:09:01.77,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(748,281)}A random ribbon cable
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.45,0:09:01.87,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So, you know those things called ribbon cables?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.87,0:09:04.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Um, about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.42,0:09:04.42,Music,,0,0,0,,♫Doraichi - 雨の休日 (A Rainy Day Off)♫
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.00,0:09:07.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So, remember how I said the Microsoft Surface Pro 1
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.78,0:09:10.55,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,is a touchscreen tablet? So...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.55,0:09:12.58,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,you know how sometimes there's glued displays
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.58,0:09:14.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and you gotta use picks and stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.32,0:09:17.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I kinda went in with the pry tool and just went...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.33,0:09:18.52,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\move(560,890,1350,350)}Shing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.52,0:09:21.92,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Yup! The digitizer, aka the touchscreen sensor,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.92,0:09:23.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,got sliced in the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.93,0:09:24.87,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake\an5\pos(1520,554)}Hehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.87,0:09:27.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,All because I wanted to slice off the glue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.75,0:09:29.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But if you wanna repair the digitizer,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.95,0:09:32.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,you have to replace the entire front glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.90,0:09:37.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And, um, that cost a hefty lot for what this device is worth today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.75,0:09:40.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So, I've chose not to self-repair it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.47,0:09:42.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Kinda awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.43,0:09:44.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Had I not run into problems
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.33,0:09:47.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,relating to the charging and the touchscreen stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.33,0:09:50.02,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I would have kept this device for a whole lot longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.02,0:09:51.23,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.23,0:09:55.20,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,it's about time. I kinda wanna let go of it and move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.20,0:10:00.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So, I'm also going to send this thing to the e-waste recycling center.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.17,0:10:03.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And hopefully, they either repair it and give it to someone in need,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.37,0:10:06.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,or just scrap it for parts and recycle properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.83,0:10:09.72,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Instead of throwing things in the trash. So, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.72,0:10:12.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Um, yeah, it's kinda depressing to think
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.77,0:10:17.05,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,that this thing has been around for 13 years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.05,0:10:21.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And it's my yet another childhood device, I would say.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.37,0:10:22.98,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,It's one of those devices.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.98,0:10:24.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Like, if you've heard of my stories of my other device,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.97,0:10:28.02,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,like my iPods and stuff, this is one of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.02,0:10:30.27,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And, um, without this,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.27,0:10:33.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have discovered all the different kinds of form factors
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.18,0:10:35.55,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,that there exist for computers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.55,0:10:38.30,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know that there was a phone computer
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.30,0:10:40.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,if it weren't for MichaelMJD.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.17,0:10:40.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Shout out to that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.20,0:10:42.77,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(778,116)}Fujitsu F-07C Atom-powered Smartphone (MichaelMJD)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.97,0:10:44.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,He's a great OG for going out of his way to make things work
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.83,0:10:47.45,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and actually just show us everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.45,0:10:50.03,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,While I'm just sitting here telling you my grand old story
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.03,0:10:54.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,about this device and then only to get it sent off to recycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.70,0:10:55.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But for real though,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.83,0:10:57.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I kinda wanna make content out of these two things
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.68,0:10:58.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,before I send it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.75,0:10:59.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.70,0:11:01.07,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,this is my way of doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.07,0:11:03.15,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hopefully, there are more happier tech videos
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.15,0:11:06.08,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,that I'll be making in the coming times. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.08,0:11:08.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna run on depression all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.17,0:11:08.73,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(1450,517)}Hehe
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.40,0:11:10.40,Music,,0,0,0,,♫Doraichi - break time♫
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.73,0:11:11.25,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Um, but, but yeah, this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.25,0:11:13.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,well, you'll be missed, I gotta be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.67,0:11:14.60,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\move(1480,540,1480,750)}Whew~
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.60,0:11:15.53,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,OtsuMelo (Farewell)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.47,0:11:18.07,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.57,0:11:19.80,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And speaking of goodbye...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.80,0:11:21.63,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Well, no, I'm not graduating, y'all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.63,0:11:23.72,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no, no, no. Put your pitchforks,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.72,0:11:25.42,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,put your cameras down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.80,0:11:28.45,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,700)\ytshake}(Crowd boos)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.80,0:11:28.45,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\ytshake\an5\pos(952,853)}(Crowd Protesting)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.85,0:11:28.57,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not graduating. I'm just saying that,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.57,0:11:33.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,today marks a unique day after a long hiatus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.83,0:11:35.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I've cleared out the studio room again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.97,0:11:37.65,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So the studio room is kinda clear
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.65,0:11:39.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and it has barely anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.77,0:11:43.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And I can now have more room to walk around in VR. Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.90,0:11:46.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And, crazy news here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.18,0:11:47.20,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.20,0:11:48.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what do ya know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.33,0:11:52.20,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I somehow procured myself this crazy little thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.20,0:11:53.23,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake\an5\pos(1450,541)}Ehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.23,0:11:56.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Um, I'm not in any position to review this yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.83,0:12:01.02,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But, this is an indication of what I'm willing to go through
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.02,0:12:06.20,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,just to remain independent and solo running on MeloriTensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.20,0:12:07.53,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I've gone out of my way
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.53,0:12:10.08,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,to hopefully learn how to use the speed editor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.08,0:12:14.02,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously, I did get DaVinci Resolve Studio license.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.02,0:12:16.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But we'll talk more about that if there's a demand for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.70,0:12:19.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But, this is a sneak peek
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.32,0:12:22.35,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,of what's majorly changed to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.35,0:12:24.63,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And hopefully, we'll address all of that
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.63,0:12:26.27,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,in the upcoming dev vlog video.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.27,0:12:27.85,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Which, I'm not sure when it's gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.85,0:12:30.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,It's probably gonna be at the end of the year or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.32,0:12:30.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(1480,549)}Hehe
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.93,0:12:33.12,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a lot to work on. and um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.12,0:12:35.55,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,As of the time of recording, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.55,0:12:38.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure the MacBook video is out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.68,0:12:41.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And, the update video is also out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.28,0:12:44.57,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Probably, I might have one or two live streams around then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.57,0:12:46.62,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe even a game highlight came out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.62,0:12:48.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure. But yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.00,0:12:52.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hopefully, I can try to do as much alone as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.67,0:12:56.25,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna discredit all the great contributors to this channel
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.25,0:12:59.05,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,that have helped me while I'm- while I'm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.05,0:13:00.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And, um, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.97,0:13:02.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna keep moving forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.33,0:13:04.08,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,There are more surprises coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.08,0:13:06.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But, I'll talk about it in a dev log video.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.17,0:13:08.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So, that's it. Thank you all so much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.28,0:13:13.30,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I am so excited for the new chapter for MeloriTensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.40,0:13:14.40,Music,,0,0,0,,♫Shuwa Shuwa Honey Lemon 350ml♫
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.30,0:13:14.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And, um, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.93,0:13:17.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I do feel sad that the Surface is leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.37,0:13:20.42,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But, again. Everyone's gonna move on some way, somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.42,0:13:21.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So, with that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.98,0:13:23.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,OtsuMelo deshita (It's been ya girl Mel).
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.77,0:13:24.92,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.95,0:13:35.55,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an4}[Ko-fi June 2026 H2]\N(I'm so sorry I have\Na weird editing pace)\N\NTove
